  "justification": "The earlier preflight stopped before device access/reservation because only the firmware README changed after early admission. That stop and old record are retained; full validation is rerun into a new immutable record without weakening membership/byte checks. No hardware attempt occurred. New matched07e1 format4 image installs bounded stack-free fault/transition capture across SCTLR and initial C stack/private memory use, restores and reads back the original runtime vector before accepting normal boot, and parks on faults. Twelve assembly cases, a normal SP_EL0 case and15 matched-code mutations pass. An additional fault experiment establishes that sp is handler SP_EL3 for interrupted SP_EL0; ESR/ELR/FAR are correct and no fault grants authority. CPU/owner/MMU engine/memory/tape bytes and1s deadline are unchanged. Rebuilt recovery receipts reproduce qualified bytes. The consumed59e9 image remains retired. Qualified mode-guarded host controls and original caps; one fresh recovery/native operation each, first failure terminal."
